<title>SOUTH AFRICA: De Beers to list on Botswana bourse Friday.</title>
<headline>De Beers to list on Botswana bourse Friday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>De Beers Consolidated Mines Ltd said on Friday the Botswana Stock Exchange had granted it a listing of 380.21 million De Beers/Centenary linked units from Friday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
